ions of americans  but it has become one of joe manchin's  biggest targets in the build back better  bill  and is it really because he honestly  thinks that  poor people if they get cash in hand  they're just going to buy drugs is that  really what he believes  does he honestly think  that every poor person in this country  everybody living in poverty is just on  drugs  is that  what he thinks the cause of poverty and  suffering is here in the united states  it's only because of drugs  if somebody is living in poverty  that in no way makes them more likely to  do drugs here in the united states  poverty is not a manifestation  that comes from addiction  and it's absolutely  embarrassing  and irresponsible  for anyone left or right  to make that claim  and if this is in fact  how joe manchin feels if he did really  say this  to his democratic colleagues which i  would love  if any one of them would come forward  and say yes mansion told me this let's  confirm it  so if this did happen  i believe at this point the democratic  party would have no choice but to kick  joe manchin out  and i believe that they should i believe  they should kick him off of his  committees  i believe that they should  refuse to give him any funding from the  party  not just based on this statement either  by the way  based on the fact that he is  obstructing the democrats own agenda  you know bernie sanders pointed out last  week in an interview with chris hayes on  msnbc  that mansion and cinema were acting like  republicans  and when you look at what republicans  have done this year nothing but  obstruction  obstruct obstruct obstruct especially in  the senate  but then when you look at mansion and  cinema  obstruct obstruct obstruct  so it is  as if they were acting like republicans  not as if they are  that is what this is joe manchin  understands what buildback better could  do  to residents of west virginia they're  not happy with him by the way the story  has been pouring in ever since his  appearance on fox news on sunday  about west virginia residents unhappy  that joe manchin is standing in the way  of this  but it all comes down at the moment to  that child tax credit  you know last week mansion  was confronted by reporters  asking why do you oppose the child tax  credit  he said it was bs your bs  this isn't true i never said that i  never did that but  i think it was october 21st  is when the news reports came out saying  that joe manchin wants to cut down the  child tax credit wants to put a cap on  it you know if you make over 60 000 a  year you don't get anything at all  so he wanted to lower the cap that was  reported back then he didn't call those  reports bs  so  he's lying  he's lying to us he's lying to his  constituents he's lying  to the country  about what he actually is trying to do  and again if this huffington post report  is accurate  and again we cannot say for certain that  it happened  but if this report is accurate  then he is basing his rationale for  killing  the extended child tax credit  on faulty and fraudulent information  and that is unacceptable considering how  much this bill  would benefit the american public  it's not going to lead to inflation  it's not going to lead to expanded drug  use here in the united states  it would help continue to lift people  out of poverty  it would help people be able to afford  their bills  it would help people have a way a  stepping stone  to creating a better life that is what  this piece of legislation would do build  back better  is literally right there in the name  folks  but joe manchin doesn't think you should  have it  because joe manchin thinks you're going  to go buy drugs  absolutely sickening  that this sitting democratic member of  the united states senate  would result to republican talking  points going all the way back by the way  to ronald reagan  right the welfare queens  the people living high on the government  hog  while the rest of you hard-working folks  